          "quote": "Let $F$ be an ordered field ([[def-ordered-field]]) with positive cone $P$, and\nlet $a, b \\in F$.\n\n1. If $a > 0$ then $a^{-1} > 0$.\n2. If $0 < a < b$ then $0 < b^{-1} < a^{-1}$.",
